{"title": "Tadpole Elixir", "pageid": 8889, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tadpole_Elixir", "categories": ["Elixirs", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/8/8d/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Tadpole Elixir image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Tadpole Elixir</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixir</a> that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Weakening\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Psionic Weakening\">Psionic Weakening</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Enrichment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Psionic Enrichment\">Psionic Enrichment</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Stimulates the pineal gland in the brain, unlocking malevolent power.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/23px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/30px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixirs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixirs</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"m