Solution_Elixir_Tadpole</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Tadpole+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Tadpole+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\nGrants <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Weakening\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Psionic Weakening\">Psionic Weakening</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Enrichment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Psionic Enrichment\">Psionic Enrichment</a> (after using an <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">Illithid power</a>). \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Psionic_Weakening\"> Condition: Psionic Weakening </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Weakening_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Weakening (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Weakening\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Weakening_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Weakening (Condition)\">Psionic Weakening</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Constitution, Wisdom and Intelligence <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>. Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Psionic_Enrichment\"> Condition: Psionic Enrichment </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Enrichment_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Enrichment (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Enrichment\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/ELX_Tadpole_Elixir_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Enrichment_(Condition)\" title=\"Psionic Enrichment (Condition)\">Psionic Enrichment</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>After using a tadpole power, affected entity gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on all attacks for 3 rounds.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness\" title=\"Sublimate of Tongue of Madness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/30px-Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/40px-Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/20px-Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sublimate_of_Tongue_of_Madness\" title=\"Sublimate of Tongue of Madness\">Sublimate of Tongue of Madness</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tongue_of_Madness\" title=\"Tongue of Madness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/20px-Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/30px-Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/40px-Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png/20px-Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Tongue_of_Madness_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tongue_of_Madness\" title=\"Tongue of Madness\">Tongue of Madness</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Essence</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195754\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3044/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47865/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10537/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1222027/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   74.127      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   74.127      1 -total\n 33.26%   24.653      8 Template:Icon_text\n 32.67%   24.215     37 Template:Trim\n 22.47%   16.658      2 Template:Condition\n 15.16%   11.241      3 Template:Uid\n 14.90%   11.042      2 Template:SmItemIcon\n  9.32%    6.906      2 Template:Condition_full/format\n  9.28%    6.881      3 Template:Icon_link\n  8.66%    6.419      1 Template:Main_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idha